# Identity project

Agent skill: [.cursor/skills/identity-agent/SKILL.md](../skills/identity-agent/SKILL.md)

## Scope

`identity/frontend`, `identity/backend`, `identity/backend/migrations` — standalone auth service.

## Ports and env

| Layer | Port | Env file |
|-------|------|----------|
| Frontend | 3001 | `identity/frontend/.env` (`VITE_*` only) |
| Backend | 4001 | `identity/backend/.env` |

Backend loads only `identity/backend/.env` (not repo root or other services).

## Ownership

- Login, register, forgot/reset password UI + APIs.
- JWT **issuance**; redirect mode via `redirect_uri` + auth code exchange.
- Database: `identity` (MySQL).

## Integration

Redirect login: WebOnOne `/login` → Identity with `redirect_uri`; callback exchanges auth code for JWT. Reference: `webonone-v2/frontend/src/features/auth/utils/identityConfig.ts`, `identity/frontend` login embed mode. Cross-service rules: [microservice-architecture.mdc](microservice-architecture.mdc).

## Verification

```bash
npm run type-check -w identity-root
npm run migrate   # from identity/
```

